  "extract": "Monstera deliciosa, the Swiss cheese plant or split-leaf philodendron, is a species of flowering plant. The common name \"Swiss cheese plant\" is also used for the related species from the same genus, Monstera adansonii. The common name \"split-leaf philodendron\" is also used for the species Philodendron bipinnatifidum.",
  "extract_html": "<p><i><b>Monstera deliciosa</b></i>, the <b>Swiss cheese plant</b> or <b>split-leaf philodendron</b>, is a species of flowering plant. The common name \"Swiss cheese plant\" is also used for the related species from the same genus, <i>Monstera adansonii</i>. The common name \"split-leaf philodendron\" is also used for the species <i>Philodendron bipinnatifidum</i>.</p>"
